              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iCH0GyDH6j88TX670"><p>Once you have a basic routine in place, incorporate targeted treatments to address specific concerns. Consider adding a serum that focuses on issues like dark spots, fine lines, or hydration. Popular ingredients for these concerns include vitamin C, hyaluronic acid, or retinol. Additionally, exfoliate your skin 1-2 times a week with a chemical exfoliant like AHAs or BHAs. This will help remove dead skin cells and promote cell turnover, keeping your skin smooth and glowing.</p></div></div
